    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“You move before the map exists.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The Fool (Catalyst).</strong> You are motion before certainty, risk before consensus, and the destabilizing force that turns unknown ground into lived reality.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype strengthens exploration, scouting, improvisation, and risky openings. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Intrigue</strong> and <strong>+1 Logistics</strong> in faction calculus.</li><li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit.</li></ul>",
